e (Delivery guarantee). Message offsets that help consumers (The Backend Spring Boot Application here) track the point till which messages have been consumed from the Kafka queue.   Deployment of the messaging application with the Kafka broker to the cloud (AWS) where replicated instances are maintained which are served with Elastic Load Balancers to forward requests fairly. ","topics":[],"score":201615,"global_rank":304728},{"name":"chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","owner":"chrisarevir","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":15,"language":"JavaScript","description":"It answers","topics":[],"score":201615,"global_rank":304732},{"name":"GuitarOTronic/foosberry","owner":"GuitarOTronic","html_url":"https://github.com/GuitarOTronic/foosberry","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":22,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Client for FoosPi 7' touch screen ","topics":[],"score":201615,"global_rank":304733},{"name":"billcoury/news_scraper","owner":"billcoury","html_url":"https://github.com/billcoury/news_scraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":8,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":201615,"global_rank":304736},{"name":"JeremySB/FileBoard","owner":"JeremySB","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremySB/FileBoard","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Web application for a class project that used Fabric.js for a sort of digital whiteboard, and saved users' canvases to the database in the background.","topics":[],"score":201610,"global_rank":304742},{"name":"sergioharo/igoogle-comics-gadget","owner":"sergioharo","html_url":"https://github.com/sergioharo/igoogle-comics-gadget","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"iGoogle Gadget to view all your daily comics in one page","topics":[],"score":201608,"global_rank":304744},{"name":"jrolstad/Chrome.Extension.SeattleTraffic","owner":"jrolstad","ht